{"text": "He also had a little bull pup named Andrew Jackson, who looked lazy until money was bet on him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he became a different dog, and in a fight he would grab the other dogs back leg and hold on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But one day he met a dog that had no back legs, so he had nothing to hold on to. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Looking at Smiley with a broken heart, the poor pup walked away, and soon after that he died. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One day Smiley caught a frog and took it home to his back yard, where he spent three months teaching it to jump. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He named the frog Daniel Webster, and soon it could turn a somersault in the air like a doughnut. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He also taught the frog to catch flies, and it could snap up any fly that came close enough. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Smiley said that all a frog needed was education, and that with it, a frog could do almost anything. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Though he was so gifted, he was modest, and on flat ground he could jump farther than any frog you ever saw. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Smiley kept him in a little box with holes in it, and sometimes he carried it into town to look for a bet.", "alignment": {"characters": ["H", "e", " ", "a", "l", "s", "o", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "b", "u", "l", "l", " ", "p", "u", "p", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "A", "n", "d", "r", "e", "w", " ", "J", "a", "c", "k", "s", "o", "n", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "l", "a", "z", "y", " ", "u", "n", "t", "i", "l", " ", "m", "o", "n", "e", "y", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "b", "e", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "h", "i", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "b", "e", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "a", " ", "d", "i", "f", "f", "e", "r", "e", "n", "t", " ", "d", "o", "g", ",", " ", "